        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Postcolonial history examines the history, legacy, and ongoing effects of European colonialism.\nIt encompasses the Subaltern Studies project (recovering colonial subjects' perspectives),\nSaid's critique of Orientalism, and efforts to de-center European historical frameworks. The\nfield challenges who tells history, whose perspective counts, and what categories are used."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-POSTCOLONIAL.md#003",
      "path": [
        "06-POSTCOLONIAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:social-history:06-postcolonial, git-history:social-history:06-postcolonial]",
